<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px">Welcome to Madar, Sara</h1>
<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 24px">Your office invites you to Madar. Open the link to set your password.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px"><a href="https://madar.test/welcome?token_hash=abc&amp;type=invite" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:10px;background:#1d1d1f;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">Accept the invitation</a></p>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6e6e73;margin:0 0 8px">If the button does not open, copy this link into your browser:</p>
<p dir="ltr" style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6e6e73;margin:0 0 24px;word-break:break-all">https://madar.test/welcome?token_hash=abc&amp;type=invite</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6e6e73;margin:0">The link works one time, for 1 hour. If it ended, open it anyway and press &quot;Send me a new link&quot;.</p>
</div>
</body></html>",
  "subject": "Your invitation to Madar",
  "text": "Welcome to Madar, Sara

Your office invites you to Madar. Open the link to set your password.

Accept the invitation: https://madar.test/welcome?token_hash=abc&type=invite

The link works one time, for 1 hour. If it ended, open it anyway and press "Send me a new link".",
}
`;

